                    "Experienced Enterprise Architect/Collaboration Architect with a demonstrated history of working in the apparel and fashion industry. Strong engineering professional skilled in Business Process, Enterprise Architecture, System integration, Electronic Data Interchange (EDI), Databases, IT Design, IT development and IT Strategy. KEY DELIVERIES: • Established Enterprise Architecture organization. • Making Enterprise Architecture agile creating Collaboration Architecture definition and roadmap. • Define, design and creation of tools for IT architecture modeling environment • Defined and build the EA Framework and taxonomy. • Anchoring the overall business definitions in the EA model in corporation with our business management • Mapping the IT landscape • In corporation with our business, documenting overall business ambitions and visions • Defining our cloud strategy • Broker strategy and platform decision • Setting the overall standards for information sharing strategy and data architecture. • Strategic analyses and IT strategy definitions including IT architectonic foundations • Security assessment and risk impact analyses in our IT environment • Facilitating EU-GDPR analyses automation and assessment execution • Analyze and decision making of new ERP setup • Central ERP roadmap • Various implementations and system upgrade • Agile and product delivery strategy • Cross and inner team collaboration, design facilitation and best practices execution • Roadmap and strategy for\nteam collaboration, design facilitation and best practices execution • Roadmap and strategy for Digital Partner Connectivity vision • Platform connectivity implementation introducing microservice architecture in IT environment • Strategy and architectural design supporting VMI and CMI solutions • Strategy for decentral DIH and strategic roadmap for centralized distribution service architecture • Strategic roadmap and design of IT deliveries for Material management and BOM management enabling sustainability focus. •. Implementation Warehouse Management Solution in automatet warehouse. •. Implementation of Supplier Collaboration Platform. Implementing MuleSoft as strategic integration platform, introducing interface first as best practice.\n## Skills\neu-gdpr, security, decision making, strategic analyses, warehouse management, roadmap strategy, cloud computing, impact analysis, information sharing, service architecture, anchoring, erp, microservice architecture, design, platform management, agile, roadmap development, databases, implementation, history, electronic data interchange, architectural design, upgrade, risk management, connectivity, facilitating, framework, management, mapping, automation, broker, cloud strategy, development, roadmap design, architecture, vmi, electronics, strategic roadmap, supplier management, material management, distribution, strategic integration, execution, agile product delivery, architect, analysis, architecture modeling, delivery strategy, service, warehouse, interface, engineering, system upgrade, enterprise architecture, apparel, bill of materials (bom), mulesoft, collaboration architecture, interchange, sustainability, security assessment, strategy, microservices, agile product management, design facilitation, standards, integration, best practices, business management, data, documenting, facilitation, collaboration, assessment, modeling, ea, fashion, bom management, supplier collaboration, dih, design creation, delivery, architecture definition, product delivery",
