                  filename: null,
                  title: "Eliel Michelmann Gaspar",
                  snippet:
                    "## Current Position\n**Systems Developer I**\n- Service and consulting for more than 20 large companies - Modeling and installation of applications in cloud environments - Database modeling - Web architecture modeling - Development of APIs and Microservices - Development of CI/CD pipelines - Source code review - Use of best practices for versioning\n### Systems Developer I at Senai São Paulo · São Bernardo do Campo, São Paulo, Brazil (2023-01-01 – Present)\n**Specialist**  \n- Service and consulting for more than 20 large companies - Modeling and installation of applications in cloud environments - Database modeling - Web architecture modeling - Development of APIs and Microservices - Development of CI/CD pipelines - Source code review - Use of best practices for versioning\n## Skills\nci/cd, engineer, service consulting, react, best practices, architecture, source code review, api creation, pipelines, modeling, support, consulting, cloud environments, infrastructure, technical services, product performance, development, installation, co-founder, application development, customer service, technical skills, core, web development, code review, systems management, systems, gap, ui/ux, educational solutions, database, mobile devices, software developer, microservices, cloud infrastructure, engagement, apis, code, reliability, bridging, versioning, infrastructure support, design, banking, assistant, ci/cd pipelines, web architecture, cloud applications, architecture modeling, react native, led, cloud computing, systems developer, com, developer, database modeling, cloud infrastructure support, review, it assistant, it, user engagement, software engineering, titanium, service, startup, system reliability, managed cloud",
